                    <num>649A</num>
                    <heading>Functions and powers of NOPSEMA in its capacity as the Offshore Infrastructure Regulator</heading>
                    <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__sec-649A__subsec-1">
                      <num>1</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>A reference in this Act to the functions or powers of NOPSEMA does not include a reference to any functions or powers of NOPSEMA in its capacity as the Offshore Infrastructure Regulator.</p>
                      </content>
                      <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
